    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				exterior part of the membrum virile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sat.Gon.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.171
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stamen</i> of a flower, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> as nautical term, prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταμίν</span>
			, Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>shaft</i> or <i>bearing</i> in which axle of slip-hook works,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				76.6
			</span></i>.</div>
